Hanumān greets unhurt Sītā beneath śiṃśapā --- Sītā urges Rāma come with troops in matching glory --- Hanumān vows Kākutstha comes to end grief --- Hanumān bows and climbs flowered Ariṣṭa peak --- Mountain rocks shatter beneath his tread --- Hanumān grows surveys ocean and springs north --- Pressed mountain sinks with roaring beasts and fleeing spirits
